c: Moves behind monsters and attacks them, respecting shields.\n\nDungeon Wave Monitoring: Monitors current wave and triggers leave when wave limit reached.\n\nDungeon Teleport on Leave: Teleports player to selected map after leaving dungeon.\n\nDungeon Cooldown Timer: Shows cooldown time between dungeon runs.\n\nPause/Resume Other Systems: Pauses other scripts during raid/dungeon to avoid conflicts.\n\nTools - Options:\nAntiAFK: Prevents automatic kick due to inactivity by simulating user input.\n\nWhite Screen Enabled: Disables 3D rendering for performance or stealth.\n\nWhite Screen Disabled: Re-enables 3D rendering.\n\nLow VFX Mode: Minimizes visual effects by altering terrain, materials, and disabling particle effects.\n\nBoost FPS: Disables textures, visual effects, particles, skies, and sets quality low to improve FPS.\n\nTools - Addons:\nCopy Position: Copies player’s current position to clipboard.\n\nRejoin: Teleports player to current place to rejoin server.\n\nHop Server: Finds and teleports player to another public server with open slots.\n\nCopy JobID: Copies current game job (server) ID to clipboard.\n\nJoin JobID: Teleports player to a server by inputting a JobID.\n\nClose UI: Closes and destroys the script's GUI.\n\nUtility / Miscellaneous:\nSave & Load Configs: Uses SaveManager & InterfaceManager to save/load user settings.\n\nNotification on Script Load: Shows notification when script finishes loading.\n\nMultiple Spawned Coroutines: For raid/dungeon automation loops and cooldown updates.\n\nSafe Remote Calls: Uses pcall for server event firing to avoid crashes.","tags":["keyless","op","animekingdomsimulator","anime","simulator"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"672d6c43581b531274708bdf","username":"egoo","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7da9ba3fdd346d4c1c8f55758f8fa7ea832fc5fa66d4a7e97ded0bbce541eea7.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/672d6c43581b531274708bdf-1752529683191.png"},"status"